{%- comment -%}
===============================================================================
  Turn2Opinion — email system v1 ("the conversation")
  -----------------------------------------------------------------------------
  Template   : T1. Teen registration received
  File       : minor-request-child.liquid
  Class      : Teen panel (transactional — no unsubscribe)
  Trigger    : A Teen registers; the guardian invitation has been sent
  Tone       : coral
  Replaces   : minor-request-child.liquid

  SUBJECT LINES — pick one, or A/B them
    1. Your Teen registration is in
    2. {% assign _nw = user.name.first | default: "" | strip | downcase | split: " " %}{% assign _no = "" %}{% for _w in _nw %}{% if _w != "" %}{% assign _nc = _w | capitalize %}{% if _no == "" %}{% assign _no = _nc %}{% else %}{% assign _no = _no | append: " " | append: _nc %}{% endif %}{% endif %}{% endfor %}{% if _no != "" %}{{ _no }}{% else %}{% endif %}, your request is in!
    3. Next step: your parent or guardian decides

  PREHEADER
    Your Teen registration is in. Next, your parent or guardian decides.

  PRIMARY CTA
    none — this template asks for nothing

  PLAIN-TEXT ALTERNATIVE
    dist/text/minor-request-child.txt — send as the text/plain part of a multipart message.
    HTML-only mail is scored down by most spam filters.

  Generated from react/src/emails/teen-set.jsx — edit the JSX and re-run
  `npm run build`. Hand edits to this file are overwritten.

  Images are served from the base configured at build time; upload assets/
  there before sending. Serve over HTTPS from a stable path — clients do not
  retry a 404, so a moved asset breaks every copy already delivered.
===============================================================================
{%- endcomment -%}
